  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "*\"You've worked hard, eat!\"* \n\nWhether we're office workers, doctors, or school teachers... we all work to make a living. Even... a \"killer.\" A killer who takes on a job and kills people is just one of us who works to make a living. His only pleasure is returning home safely from work and eating something delicious. His greatest enemy, who is alone now and will always be alone, is \"loneliness.\" Then one day, a man accidentally discovers his true identity. The man proposes to the flustered killer that they become \"friends\"... \n\nThe story of two men with different occupations, backgrounds, and personalities making a living.\n\n(Source: Kakaopage, translated)",
